# MindBridge SaaS Platform — Full Project Report

> **Date**: July 5, 2026  
> **Platform**: Student Mental Wellness SaaS with AI Companion (Comrade)  
> **Stack**: FastAPI + PostgreSQL (backend) · React + Vite + TypeScript (frontend)

---

## Executive Summary

MindBridge is a multi-tenant SaaS application designed for student mental wellness. It features an AI companion called **Comrade** (powered by Gemini 2.5 Flash), a parent–student linking system, counselor tools, school admin analytics, and a memory engine that allows the AI to remember student context across conversations.

**4 phases have been implemented. 2 phases remain.**

