### AI Architecture

```
Student sends message
  → Store user message in DB
  → Load active prompt (DB or fallback)
  → Load student memories (top 5 + pinned)
  → Inject memories into system prompt
  → Load conversation history (last 20 msgs)
  → Build prompt payload
  → Call Gemini 2.5 Flash (with retry on 429)
  → Log safety events (self-harm, abuse, violence keywords)
  → Store AI response + metadata in DB
  → Trigger conversation summary hook (if threshold met)
  → Trigger auto-rename (after 4th message)
  → Trigger memory extraction
  → Return both messages to frontend
```

### Safety Logging

Keywords monitored: `self-harm`, `suicide`, `kill myself`, `abuse`, `hurt me`, `violence`, etc.

When detected:
- Creates entry in `safety_audit_logs` with severity, conversation_id, user_id
- Does NOT trigger any workflows yet (Phase 5)

