### ⚠️ Known Issue: Auto-Rename

The conversation auto-rename feature (changes "New Conversation" to a descriptive title after 2 exchanges) is **code-complete** but frequently fails due to **Gemini free tier rate limits** (20 requests/day). Each message exchange makes up to 3 Gemini calls (response + title gen + memory extraction), exhausting the quota quickly.

**Fix**: Upgrade to Gemini paid tier, or reduce concurrent Gemini calls by deferring title generation and memory extraction to a background task.

